<title>INDONESIA: BADMINTON-INDONESIAN OPEN FINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-INDONESIAN OPEN FINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals in the Indonesian Open badminton tournament on Sunday (Indonesian unless stated):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Ardi Wiranata beat Marleve Mainaky 15-9 15-3</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Susi Susanti beat Meiluawati 11-4 11-5</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Trikus Haryanto/Minarto Timur beat Bambang Suprianto/Rosalina Riseu 15-11 15-6</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Resiana Zelin/Eliza beat Finarsih/Minarti Timur 15-10 15-5</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Sigit Budiarto/Wijaya Chandra beat Yoo Yong-sung/Lee Don-soo (South Korea) 15-9 15-10</p>
</text>
